  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> are two independent events. If the probability that both <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> occur together is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math> and the probability that neither of them occurs is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>, then the probability of occurrence of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "QtMpA",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mtext>&#160;or&#160;</mtext><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "N9DZR",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mtext>&#160;or&#160;</mtext><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "c50rX",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mtext>&#160;or&#160;</mtext><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "YHWeg",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mtext>&#160;or&#160;</mtext><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></msup><mo>&#8745;</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>C</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></msup><mo>&#8745;</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>But&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> are independent events</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>25</mn><mn>36</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>36</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>On solving Eqs. (i) and (ii), we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mtext>&#160;or&#160;</mtext><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence, option (b) is correct.</p>",
